 "transcript": [
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and what of that? I am a man and I have my pleasure,\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) eldest son and second son argue",
  "[action] eldest son throws silver pieces",
  "[says] Wang Lung expresses his disapproval of his son's behavior.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well now, and that is not to be done in my house. Now I have told you before that that is not the way to spend money. I did not make my money by idleness, and you shall not either. That is not what your old man says.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung takes silver",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now I will not have you living in idleness in my house. You have your own house in the town and I have given you silver enough to buy slaves to wait upon you, and if you cannot find a woman, there are always men and boys and there is that one in the great house whom I gave to you and who is yours, and if he does not please you, there are others.\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung gives silver to second son",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung gives silver to eldest son",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and why not? I am a man and I will do as I please. I do not want slaves,\"",
